  "theorem": "For the Pass10951 order-eight determinant-odd clock lift, every odd power acts on qutrit density matrices as a unitary-conjugated transpose. Its Choi operator has inertia (6,3,0), so it is positive and trace preserving but not completely positive. Every even power is a unitary Clifford channel with Choi inertia (1,0,8). Thus the operational single-qutrit clock is the even C4 subgroup. A 6D carrier H plus conjugate(H) restores a unitary order-eight lift. The abstract fourth power -I is scalar in the 2T spin representation but non-scalar in the 3D qutrit Clifford representation."
